              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo nawe ntuz’ utugirire nabi, nk’uko natwe tutakuriye n’urwara, ata co twakugize atar’ ivyiza gusa, kandi tukaba twagusēzeye amahoro. Tubonye k’Uhoraho yaguhaye. ",
